          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer cash-on-delivery (COD)?",
            "description": "<p>Yes, COD is available for our <a href=\"https://www.doggyji.com/shop/doggy-ji-biscuits/doggy-ji-v-bitevegan-biscuits-48-packets/\">pack of 48 Doggyji Chicken Biscuits</a> for an additional ₹60. You can check its availability at checkout.</p>"
