          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer free shipping?",
            "description": "<p>We often run special promotions with free shipping. Check <a href=\"https://www.doggyji.com/\">our website</a> or Amazon page for the latest deals.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_gYfYg9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why are shipping charges applied to orders?",
            "description": "<p>Our biscuits are affordably priced, and shipping heavy packages adds significant costs. We charge a nominal shipping fee to ensure our products remain budget-friendly while balancing delivery expenses.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_QTwQFW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I buy Doggyji products?",
            "description": "<p>You can purchase Doggyji treats directly from our website at <a href=\"http://www.doggyji.com/\">www.doggyji.com</a> or through Amazon India . We’re also working to make our products available on platforms like Blinkit and BigBasket.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_B76fJT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you deliver across India?",
            "description": "<p>Yes! We deliver nationwide through our website and Amazon logistics, ensuring timely and reliable service to every corner of India.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_qfxqnw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I update my shipping address after ordering?",
            "description": "<p>Yes, you can update your shipping address if the order hasn’t shipped yet. <a href=\"https://www.doggyji.com/contact-us/\">Contact us</a> immediately to make the change.</p>"
          }
        }
