          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I contact Doggyji?",
            "description": "<p>You can reach us via email at info@doggyji.com, call us at +91 8660808858, or use the <a href=\"https://www.doggyji.com/contact-us/\">contact form</a> on our website. We’re here to help!</p>"
